================================================================================
Third-party code included in this repository
================================================================================

No third-party code is vendored here: nothing is copied in. Every dependency is
declared, fetched at build time, and listed with its version in:

  backend/requirements.txt          (Python)
  frontend/package-lock.json        (JavaScript)

The licences of those dependencies are their own.

Two of them are worth naming, because they end up inside the frontend image and
are served to every browser:

  Font Awesome Free (icons and fonts)   CC BY 4.0 / SIL OFL 1.1 / MIT
                                        https://fontawesome.com/license/free

The icons are bundled deliberately rather than loaded from a CDN, so that the
portal works with no internet access at all.

================================================================================
Inspiration
================================================================================

Portal-NG is inspired by Homer (https://github.com/bastienwirtz/homer, Apache
License 2.0) and reads and writes its configuration format, so that an existing
Homer instance can be imported. No Homer code is used.
